{"explanation":"Strengthen the existing MasterKey lifecycle regression test without changing its entry point or its existing successful decryption expectations. The test already covers generation, JSON persistence, and successful AES key recovery; it now also fails explicitly if an incorrect password is accepted.","review_assumptions":["The coordinated MasterKey implementation continues to report an incorrect-password AES/GCM authentication failure as AEADBadTagException on supported Android providers.","Persisted MasterKey JSON metadata and representation remain unchanged by the coordinated production edits."],"no_change_required":false,"decision":"MULTI_FILE_FIX_PROPOSED_FOR_REVIEW","confidence":"high","edits":[{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/androidTest/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/MasterKeyTest.java","original_code":"    @Test
    public void test() throws GeneralSecurityException, IOException {
        String pwd = "MyM4sterPassw0rd";
        String wrongpwd = "Incorrectpwd";

        MasterKey orig = MasterKey.generate(pwd);
        MasterKey read = new Gson().fromJson(new Gson().toJson(orig), MasterKey.class);

        Assert.assertArrayEquals(orig.decrypt(pwd).getEncoded(), read.decrypt(pwd).getEncoded());
        assertEquals(orig.decrypt(pwd).getAlgorithm(), "AES");
        assertEquals(read.decrypt(pwd).getAlgorithm(), "AES");

        try {
            orig.decrypt(wrongpwd);
        } catch (AEADBadTagException e) {
            // Expected
            // javax.crypto.AEADBadTagException:
            // error:1e000065:Cipher functions:OPENSSL_internal:BAD_DECRYPT
        }
    }","edit_kind":"test","corrected_code":"    @Test
    public void test() throws GeneralSecurityException, IOException {
        String pwd = "MyM4sterPassw0rd";
        String wrongpwd = "Incorrectpwd";

        MasterKey orig = MasterKey.generate(pwd);
        MasterKey read = new Gson().fromJson(new Gson().toJson(orig), MasterKey.class);

        Assert.assertArrayEquals(orig.decrypt(pwd).getEncoded(), read.decrypt(pwd).getEncoded());
        assertEquals(orig.decrypt(pwd).getAlgorithm(), "AES");
        assertEquals(read.decrypt(pwd).getAlgorithm(), "AES");

        try {
            orig.decrypt(wrongpwd);
            Assert.fail("Decrypting a MasterKey with an incorrect password must fail authentication");
        } catch (AEADBadTagException e) {
            // Expected
            // javax.crypto.AEADBadTagException:
            // error:1e000065:Cipher functions:OPENSSL_internal:BAD_DECRYPT
        }
    }","reason":"Retain the existing generated-MasterKey, JSON round-trip, recovered key-encoding, and AES-algorithm assertions while making the existing incorrect-password AES/GCM authentication expectation enforceable. This exercises the unchanged MasterKey.generate(String) and decrypt(String) entry points after the coordinated generated-AES-key lifecycle change." ,"symbol":"MasterKeyTest.test"}],"manual_review_required":true,"provided_contracts":["MasterKeyTest continues to exercise the unchanged MasterKey.generate(String) and decrypt(String) entry points.","MasterKeyTest preserves the existing successful decrypted-key encoding and AES algorithm assertions across JSON serialization.","MasterKeyTest now explicitly verifies that an incorrect password is rejected with AES/GCM authentication failure."],"required_contracts":["MasterKey retains its existing constructor and public generate(String) and decrypt(String) entry points, checked exceptions, PBKDF2 metadata, and persisted encrypted-key representation.","MasterKey generates the protected AES master key through an AES KeyGenerator and passes it to EncryptedKey.encrypt with the unchanged argument order.","EncryptedKey.encrypt retains its public caller-facing signature and its decryptable AES/GCM record representation."],"source_file_path":"mobile/src/androidTest/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/MasterKeyTest.java","required_tests":["Run mobile/src/androidTest/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/MasterKeyTest.java on supported Android providers and verify successful MasterKey generation, JSON round-trip recovery, and AEADBadTagException for an incorrect password.","Compile all coordinated androidTest sources with the production MasterKey and EncryptedKey changes."]}
